    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13418" root="دورد" body-key="d">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُدَوَّرٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُدَارٌ</span></b>  [<i>Made round,</i> meaning both
<i>circular</i> and <i>spherical; rounded;</i> and simply <i>round:</i>
the former word is the more common: of the
latter, see an ex. in a verse cited voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">يَلَبٌ</span>: and
see also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُسْتَدِيرٌ</span>].

